id: PACK43-1
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: compile_chapters
target: crates/pack/src/chapter_range.rs
find:     ir.starts.retain(|s| keep.contains(&s.node));
replace:     ir.starts.retain(|_| true);
expect-fail: pack43_narrowed_ir_has_no_out_of_range_start
note: 刈り込みで開始点の絞り込みが外れ、範囲外の章の開始点が IR に残る（PACK-43）
